source: tests/cli/snapshots.rs
---
Show one cohort by period — retention matrix + cumulative LTV curve + prediction

Usage: vendo measurement ltv cohort [OPTIONS] <period>

Arguments:
  <period>  

Options:
      --granularity <value>  daily | weekly | monthly [default: monthly]
      --segment <key>        Segment key [default: all]
      --json                 Output raw JSON
  -h, --help                 Print help

Global options:
      --profile <name>  Use a specific account profile
      --debug           Enable verbose request diagnostics

Examples:
  $ vendo measurement ltv cohort 2025-01-01
  $ vendo measurement ltv cohort 2025-01-01 --granularity weekly --segment channel:meta
  $ vendo measurement ltv cohort 2025-01-01 --json
